# Frontend UI/UX Component Standardization Report
**Last Updated:** March 2026 | **Scope:** `src/pages/**`, `src/components/**`

---

## 1. Executive Summary

The NexusAI ERP application was built iteratively across 700+ page files and 100+ shared components. This report is the **March 2026 refresh v4** — all previously completed phases are archived and **14 new anti-pattern categories (AD–AQ)** have been discovered through a deep codebase re-scan.

