## 2. Standardized Component Reference

### 2.1 Core Layout
- **`StandardPage`** — Universal page wrapper (`title`, `description`, `actions` slot)
- **`StandardDashboard`** — Analytical/KPI screens
- **`AdminLayout`** — All `/admin` screens

### 2.2 Data Display
- **`InteractiveSpreadsheet`** + `SpreadsheetColumn` — Bulk data entry grid
- **`DataTable`** — Pagination-ready data wrapper
- **`KanbanBoard`** — Workflow visualization
- **`chart.tsx`** — Recharts wrapper with design tokens

### 2.3 Shared Domain
- **`ContextualSearch` / `GlobalSearch`** — Search bars
- **`EnterpriseContextSwitcher`** — Multi-tenant scoping
- **`ExportButton` / `ExcelExportButton`** — Data export
- **`AlertDialog`** — All destructive action confirmations
- **`StatusBadge`** — Standardized status rendering
- **`PageSkeleton` / `TableSkeleton`** — Loading placeholders
- **`EmptyState`** — Standardized no-data states
- **`PromptDialog`** — Controlled text-input modals
- **`ErrorBoundaries`** — `RootErrorBoundary` / `WidgetErrorBoundary`

### 2.4 Base UI Primitives (`src/components/ui/`)
`Button`, `Card`, `Dialog`, `Sheet`, `Form`, `Input`, `Select`, `Textarea`, `Tabs`, `Badge`, `Skeleton`, `Toaster`, `Calendar`, `DatePicker`, `Progress`, `Tooltip`, `Pagination`, `Label`

