## 6. Linting / CI Prevention Recommendations

| Rule | Enforcement |
|------|-------------|
| No `window.confirm()` / `window.prompt()` / `alert()` | ESLint `no-restricted-globals` |
| No `import from 'sonner'` | ESLint `no-restricted-imports` |
| No `<input type="date">` | ESLint custom / `no-restricted-jsx-attribute` |
| No `style={{ ... }}` (non-dynamic) | ESLint `react/forbid-component-props` |
| No `text-green-*` / `bg-red-*` status colors | ESLint custom rule |
| Require `cn()` for dynamic classNames | ESLint `clsx/no-template-literals` (custom) |
| Prevent arbitrary spacial brackets `-[...px]` | ESLint `tailwindcss/no-arbitrary-value` |
| No `console.log` / `console.warn` / `console.error` | ESLint `no-console` (error level) |
| Require `aria-label` on `size="icon"` buttons | ESLint `jsx-a11y/interactive-supports-focus` + custom |
| No `type="submit"` without `disabled` prop | ESLint custom rule |
| No hardcoded `'en-US'` / `'USD'` in format calls | ESLint `no-restricted-syntax` |
| **No raw HTML `<label>` elements** | **ESLint `no-restricted-jsx-elements`** |
| **No arbitrary typography `text-[...px]`** | **ESLint `tailwindcss/no-arbitrary-value` extended** |
| **Require `rel="noopener"` with `target="_blank"`** | **ESLint `react/jsx-no-target-blank`** |
| **Enforce `<Link>` over `<a href>` for internal routing** | **ESLint `no-restricted-elements` or custom router rule** |
| **Forbid `.css` file imports (excluding globals)** | **ESLint `no-restricted-imports`** |
| **Forbid direct DOM state queries (`document.getElementById`)** | **ESLint `no-restricted-properties` on `document`** |
